00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,540
How did the dream end?
美梦是怎么破灭的？

2
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,970
How did the dream end?
美梦是怎么破灭的？

3
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,620
Tired of sleeping on the floor,
由于厌倦了睡地板，

4
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:26,450
a young man in Teheran saved up for years to buy a real bed.
德黑兰的一个年轻人攒了好几年的钱，想买一张真正的床。

5
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,390
For the first time in his life,
他有生以来第一次

6
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:36,210
he became the proud owner of a bed which had springs and a mattress.
成了拥有一张带弹簧和床垫的床的骄傲主人。

7
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:40,620
Because the weather was very hot,
因为天气很热，

8
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:44,610
he carried the bed on to the roof of his house.
他把床搬到了屋顶上。

9
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:48,860
He slept very well for the first two nights,
头两个晚上他睡得很好，

10
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:52,990
but on the third night, a storm blew up.
但第三天夜里刮起了暴风雨。

11
00:00:54,490 --> 00:01:02,260
A gust of wind swept the bed off the roof and sent it crashing into the courtyard below.
一阵狂风把床从屋顶上刮了下来，坠入下面的院子。

12
00:01:03,870 --> 00:01:08,620
The young man did not wake up until the bed had struck the ground.
年轻人直到床撞到地面上才醒来。

13
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:13,270
Although the bed was smashed to pieces,
虽然床被摔得粉碎，

14
00:01:13,290 --> 00:01:16,450
the man was miraculously unhurt.
那人却奇迹般地没有受伤。

15
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:20,970
When he woke up, he was still on the mattress.
他醒来时还躺在床垫上。

16
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:26,460
Glancing at the bits of wood and metal that lay around him,
他看了一眼散落在周围的木片和金属碎片，

17
00:01:27,230 --> 00:01:32,260
the man sadly picked up the mattress and carried it into his house.
伤心地把床垫捡起来，搬进了屋。

18
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:37,890
After he had put it on the floor, he promptly went to sleep again.
把床垫放在地板上之后，他很快又睡着了。
